{"id":"e39710a1818d0447","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-number-realizability-with-truth.md","title":"Numerical realizability with truth","display":"df-number-realizability-with-truth — Numerical realizability with truth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-number-realizability-with-truth","aliases":["72-df-number-realizability-with-truth"],"display":"df-number-realizability-with-truth — Numerical realizability with truth","depends_on":["[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, section 1.6, Definition, printed p. 413, PDF p. 425; primitive-disjunction convention from section 1.1, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420","source_relation":"External numeric-environment rnt specialization with the existing 0/1 tagged primitive disjunction; not internal HA-star syntax","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; all recursive clauses and truth conjunct checked against page image","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-number-realizability-with-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-number-realizability-with-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-number-realizability-with-truth — Numerical realizability with truth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, section 1.6, Definition, printed p. 413, PDF p. 425; primitive-disjunction convention from section 1.1, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420"},{"key":"source_relation","html":"External numeric-environment rnt specialization with the existing 0/1 tagged primitive disjunction; not internal HA-star syntax"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; all recursive clauses and truth conjunct checked against page image"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>、环境更新、固定可接受部分递归函数编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 及双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0,p_1\">\\(p_0,p_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\">\\(t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}\">\\(\\mathsf{AT}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a> 的标准真值关系。以下按有限公式树递归引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NRT}\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathsf{NRT}\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；右侧量词及联结词属于元语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\">\\(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\)</span> 使用既有部分计算图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(t=_a s,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NRT}(n,t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(t=_a s,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NRT}(p_0(n),A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),B,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NRT}(p_0(n),A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),B,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(p_0(n)=0\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),A,\\eta))\\lor\n(p_0(n)=1\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),B,\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(p_0(n)=0\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),A,\\eta))\\lor\n(p_0(n)=1\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),B,\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf{NRT}(m,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(k,B,\\eta)))\\right]\n\\land\\mathsf{AT}(A\\to_a B,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf{NRT}(m,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(k,B,\\eta)))\\right]\n\\land\\mathsf{AT}(A\\to_a B,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(k,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(k,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto p_0(n)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto p_0(n)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.413 在 rn 的蕴涵子句增加原公式的真值条件，称为 rnt；页图确认该条件是整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>，且输入和输出都使用 rnt。这里以现有外部数值环境表示开公式，n 总是自然数，故原书部分项语言中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\downarrow\">\\(x\\downarrow\\)</span> 已由参数类型满足。</p>\n<p>本书现有 NR 把析取当作带 0/1 标签的原始构造子，故这里沿用同一语法并补出该析取子句，而非偷偷使用 p.410 的另一非零右标签约定。来源对应为 p.408 的原始析取子句与 p.413 的真实现性改造。此变体只覆盖本书现有算术子语言，不声称已经形式化 HA* 的全部原始递归符号、部分项或可靠性定理。递归严格下降到子公式，真值项调用已定义的 AT；无循环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的 $\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a$、环境更新、固定可接受部分递归函数编号 $\\varphi_e$ 及双射 $p$ 的投影 $p_0,p_1$；$t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a$，$n\\in\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，$i\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{AT}$ 为 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]] 的标准真值关系。以下按有限公式树递归引入 $\\mathsf{NRT}\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega$；右侧量词及联结词属于元语言，$\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k$ 使用既有部分计算图。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p_0,p_1","display":false},{"tex":"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NRT}\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(t=_a s,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NRT}(p_0(n),A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),B,\\eta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(p_0(n)=0\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),A,\\eta))\\lor\n(p_0(n)=1\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),B,\\eta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf{NRT}(m,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(k,B,\\eta)))\\right]\n\\land\\mathsf{AT}(A\\to_a B,\\eta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NRT}(k,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m])).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NRT}(n,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NRT}(p_1(n),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto p_0(n)]).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"x\\downarrow","display":false}],"bytes":3487,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-223","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-number-realizability-with-truth|df-number-realizability-with-truth — Numerical realizability with tru